Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digitama.com
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally found TK,\Nand just in time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.98,0:01:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later, Devimon channeled his\Npower and became enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times they tried,\Nour Digimon couldn't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when the incredible happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.30,0:01:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon finally digivolved into\NAngemon, and using all of his energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeated Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all of his strength gone, Angemon\Nreturned to the youngest stage, a Digi-Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.46,0:02:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Devimon gone, File Island\Nbegan to rebuild itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we're all\Nback together again.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Set Sail - To a New Continent!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the Digimon defeated Devimon,\Nwe thought the worst was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, a mysterious\Nbeing appeared before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you children are the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be strong to have\Ndefeated Devimon Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a friend of Devimon's?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not, for I am a friend to all,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.06,0:02:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and yet I am a friend to\Nnone I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are actually other humans\Nbesides us in this world I am human,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and yet I am not human\NThis is confusing Hmm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.11,0:02:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my name is Gennai I couldn't send you this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,transmission during\Nyour battle with Devimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.66,0:02:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now the lines are clear and only ten
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cents a minute. Well, who\Nare you and just where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:03:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you i am speaking to you far away from
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fire island across the\Nocean on the continent
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of server talk about a long distance call\Nhow long have you been here since before
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the beginning until after the end are you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one who got us stuck\Nhere in the digital
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world it was not i then who was it it was
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't know but mr
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gennai, sir, do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what we need to do so we can all get back\Nhome again no i don't boy you're a regular
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fountain of information\Naren't you i'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i can't help you but\Nyou can be of help to me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please come to server and defeat\Nour enemies as the digitist and i
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have faith in all of you that's\Ncrazy when we don't know your exact
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,location good point i forgot you're\Nfrom out of town let me create a map
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for you on your computer huh what\Nwhat if your enemies are humongazoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we can beat\Nanything tougher than Devimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:04:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not presently, but if your\NDigimon can digivolve once more,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you might be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we can digivolve
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even more?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll need something\Nspecial to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have the tags and crests,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your Digimon will be able\Nto digivolve even further.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell us where we can\Nfind these tags and crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the crests are scattered about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can locate them all throughout\Nthe continent of Server.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.02,0:04:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the tags were secretly\Nsealed away somewhere by Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Devimon, oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm severed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gennai's transmission\Nended rather abruptly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least he was able to send\Nthe map through before he got cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's our next move going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:04:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a foolproof plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we'll eat something, and\Nafter that, I'm open to suggestions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that my stomach is\Nfull, I'm ready for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tk oh i was just wishing my digi egg would
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hurry up and hatch\Nalready so i could grow up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't sweat it little\Nbro when your digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.44,0:05:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hatches it'll be the\Ncoolest one yet exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay everyone now that we've stuffed\Nour faces what are we gonna do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next you know what's next we have to\Ngo to server to save geni from his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enemy well according to my calculations\Nof longitude and latitude i'd
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say server is quite some distance\Nfrom here i can't even swim across
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bathtub let alone an ocean i'll\Nnever make it why do we have to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go anyway what i mean is devamon's\Ngone from the island the black gears
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have disappeared too we've been once\Naround the island so we pretty much
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know where everything is we wouldn't\Nhave to worry about food or water
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you saying why\Nshould we believe what
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This weirdo Gennai guy says\Nwhat? I mean, is how do we
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even know that this place\Nserver really exists
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.50,0:06:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you thinking if\Nwe hang around here guys
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll never get back\Nhome i don't know guys
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,devimon almost got us maybe\Nwe shouldn't go at least
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we know what we're up\Nagainst over here and even
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we wanted to go what\Nmode of transportation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could we utilize we\Ndon't even know what the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fashions are like on\Nserver maybe we should stay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here a longer and think\Nthis through what's with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you man let's go huh tk
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't know what kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,danger will be waiting\Nfor us but let's see i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure angelmon would say\Nthe same thing if he were
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still around so i'm going\Nwe'll go too if we have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the tags and crests we'll\Nbe able to digivolve again
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.81,0:07:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we transform into our new shapes,\Nwe'll be able to protect you for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, so what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our chances for success are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,extremely high.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.55,0:07:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.47,0:07:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you we'll be the previous\Nflowers on Olive's server.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll swim to server. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.66,0:07:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me in. Okay, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not staying by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's unanimous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great. It's decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to server.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper Breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Timber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:07:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At our current rate, it'll take\Nus forever to build a raft.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.10,0:08:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we're in any kind of hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.78,0:08:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I heard you were all going to server.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know us monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all love to gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd see if you\Nneeded some help with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you'll really help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got some friends\Nwho want to help as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elecmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mojyamon and Starmon,\Ntoo! Yeah! Hi! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mojyamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! It's Raremon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! It's Meramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fist of the Beast King!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh that was cool
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right it's hydrodynamically\Ndesigned i think i'm getting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seasick already get a grip\Njoe it'll have to do believe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me that raft is strong enough\Nto get you across the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:10:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks leomon we never could\Nhave done it without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hatched!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boyo, Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cute! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay! He did it! Yay!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.68,0:10:29.19,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Poyomon
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.68,0:10:29.19,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Baby
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.68,0:10:29.19,Sign,,350,0,295,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Slime Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.68,0:10:29.19,Sign,,350,0,295,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.68,0:10:29.19,Sign,,350,0,295,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Bubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon is a jellyfish-type\NDigimon of few words,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if his friends are in\Ntrouble, he's ready for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And good luck. Thanks. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we sailed away from File Island where\Nwe had some really cool adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we had to survive on our\Nown, we grew up very fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except Joe, he just threw up very fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he came around, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know what's waiting for\Nus on the other side of the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we'll face it as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything. I wonder how\Nmuch longer this trip will take, chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out joe we just left the salt air\Nis killing my sinuses and we've only
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got enough food for two weeks if\Nwe run out of food we'll catch some
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fish well the one good thing is this\Nis beautiful weather for sailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't calculate these\Nwaves being so rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.44,0:11:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Poyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Poyomon, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, tidal wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That had to be 12 feet tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,18.3 to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that another boat\Nthat caused that wave?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no boat that can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since when does an island have been?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:09.35,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Whamon
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:09.35,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:09.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Aquatic Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:09.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:09.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:09.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:09.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Jet Arrow
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:09.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Giant Tidal Wave
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whamon is a giant Digimon who lives in\Nthe deep oceans of the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its jet arrows are unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was massive. A Whamon\Ncan sometimes be fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but i've never seen\None act this aggressive
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we don't give him a sore throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technically, it's not the throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the esophagus that\Nleads to the stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks we're fast food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he really did eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, this\Nhas to lead to an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does, but you don't want to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is damaging my hair\Nall the way to the roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's my roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that gross gooey junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're everybody's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're attacking us because they\Nthink we're germs or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finally we stopped is everyone okay where\Nare we anatomically speaking this would
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be the stomach the stomach isn't that\Nwhere food goes after it's chewed up yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gastric juice what it's the acid in\Nthe stomach that dissolves the food
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're melting don't let it get\Non you we better get out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.62,0:14:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we give him a major ulcer.\NTai, look up there! It's a black gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's why Whamon was acting so\Naggressive joe do something to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,help why me someone can climb on
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:15:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these poison ivy right i'll do it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I destroyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sarah, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow we got out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.85,0:15:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poyomon, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poyomon, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.18,0:15:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have had a tummy ache or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, we all know\Nit wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, it was the\Nblack gear inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those black gears are rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet that's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:16:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're wrong. Thanks, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it, Whamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was our pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you know\Nhow far it is to serve her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it would take me five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make that three and a\Nhalf without traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, our ramp's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to serve her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we were trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take you there myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not every day your\Nlunch saves your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great. This sure\Nis a whole lot faster and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoother than that raft,\Nwhich means I won't get
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we only knew where we could\Nfind those tags in those
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crests that Devimon hid\Nsomewhere Did you say Devimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know anything\Nabout tags or crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a while ago, Devimon hid something\Ndeep at the bottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell us where?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on the way to server.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can all ride inside me\Nand I'll take you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no tickling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so out of shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to rest here for a while I gotta\Ndrop a couple of thousand pounds Thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whamon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A convenience store
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jumon, Jumon!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.42,0:18:04.39,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Drimogemon
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.42,0:18:04.39,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.42,0:18:04.39,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Beast Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.42,0:18:04.39,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.42,0:18:04.39,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.42,0:18:04.39,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.42,0:18:04.39,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Drill Spin
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.42,0:18:04.39,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Crusher Bone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:18:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drimogemon lives deep inside\Nthe earth drilling tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He uses his iron drill spin and\Ncrusher bone to wipe out his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a black gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that couldn't have\Nbeen the last black gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is Lord Demomon's will\Nthat no one shall pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, leave this to us, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You try to find the tags. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you think that drill scares us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, into chapters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon, evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drill Spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.40,0:19:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heartful torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.82,0:19:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time I join the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take them on, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.90,0:19:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crusher Bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon, aim for the black gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electro-shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piximon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are ya? Piemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Piemon! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stay in this store!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's in the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.66,0:20:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for attacking you.\NPardon me, do you know where the tags are?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tags should be in the\Nconvenience store Next to the jerky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tags Just like the ones Gennai showed\Nus during his transmission How pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what Gennai told us,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you guys the crests are\Nscattered throughout the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,continent of server and if\Nwe get both the tags and the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crests we'll all be able to\Ndigivolve once again then
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.00,0:20:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to go out\Nthere and find the crests!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know when, but I'm looking\Nforward to it. I'm going to be a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.46,0:22:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future of the rain\Nwill shine on my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.90,0:23:04.94,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Etemon! Grand Entrance of Evil

